{
  "info": {
    "name": "Kno2 HubSpot Connector - CRM Objects",
    "_postman_id": "c9d6b9b8-2f5a-4db5-9a72-0b9aef3a8aa1",
    "description": "Workspace: Kno2 HubSpot Connector (placeholder).\\n\\nCollection for validating HubSpot CRM object access used by the Kno2 custom connector.\\n\\nHelpful links:\\n- HubSpot schemas: https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/schemas\\n- Partner Network Application UI: https://app-na2.hubspot.com/contacts/44204548/record/0-420/663466742505\\n- Partner Contracts UI: https://app-na2.hubspot.com/contacts/44204548/objects/2-222440285/views/all/list\\n- Partner Product Communication Details UI: https://app-na2.hubspot.com/contacts/44204548/objects/2-221836290/views/all/list\\n- Partner Products and Systems UI: https://app-na2.hubspot.com/contacts/44204548/objects/2-221830980/views/all/list\\n- Courses UI: https://app-na2.hubspot.com/contacts/44204548/objects/0-410/views/all/list\\n- Partner Product Releases UI: https://app-na2.hubspot.com/contacts/44204548/objects/0-970/views/all/list\\n\\nHow to use:\\n1) Set collection variables (baseUrl, accessToken, objectTypeId, recordId).\\n2) Run the schema request to confirm object labels and IDs.\\n3) Run list/get requests to validate visibility.\\n\\nNotes:\\n- accessToken is a HubSpot private app token.\\n- objectTypeId may be a standard object name (e.g., companies) or a custom object ID (e.g., 0-420).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Schemas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List schemas (confirm object label)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/crm/v3/schemas",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "crm", "v3", "schemas" ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Custom Objects - Partner Network Application (0-420)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Partner Network Applications",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/crm/v3/objects/0-420?limit=10",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "crm", "v3", "objects", "0-420" ],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Partner Network Application by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/crm/v3/objects/0-420/{{recordId}}",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "crm", "v3", "objects", "0-420", "{{recordId}}" ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Partner Network Application by ID (archived)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/crm/v3/objects/0-420/{{recordId}}?archived=true",
              "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
              "path": [ "crm", "v3", "objects", "0-420", "{{recordId}}" ],
              "query": [
                { "key": "archived", "value": "true" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
